      "message": "test: ubsan suppression for ProcessGetCFCheckPt\n\nWhen running with -fsanitize=integer compiled, the following could error:\n\nSUMMARY: UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer: unsigned-integer-overflow /bitcoin/src/net_processing.cpp:3662:33\nSUMMARY: UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer: implicit-signed-integer-truncation-or-sign-change /bitcoin/src/net_processing.cpp:3662:18\n\nWhen stop_index->nHeight is less than CFCHECKPT_INTERVAL, the headers\nvector will be empty. This will just set the loop counter to -1 and\nnever enter the loop, so this is harmless anyways.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Eugene Siegel",
        "email": "elzeigel@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-09-23T19:48:04Z"
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "Eugene Siegel",
        "email": "elzeigel@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-09-23T19:48:04Z"
